      "notes": [
        "For this first ballot, I gave the most weight to wins over strong opponents, especially away from home. Head-to-head and scoring margins help separate similar résumés. Most teams have played only a handful of games.",
        "Houston starts at No. 1 after neutral-court wins over Florida (86–76) and Kansas (92–83). Florida is No. 2 with wins over Miami, Notre Dame and Florida State. Virginia is No. 3 at 7–0, with a neutral-court win over Arkansas and a road win at Maryland.",
        "Texas Tech is No. 4 after its 84–78 win over Illinois. USC is No. 6 with wins over Wichita State on a neutral court and California on the road. Pittsburgh and Minnesota round out the top 10 after going 6–0 with a road win apiece."
